    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3513900302",
      "Source": "An Ultimate Challenge",
      "Trans": {"SC":"终极挑战","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::11898034",
      "Source": "Use on your mount to initiate the taming process for Smok saurovindico.<#RN#><#RN#>The following creatures in vanilla (or those childed from them), and those from Wild Ark, are the only ones who can challenge Smok.<#RN#>- Rex<#RN#>- Therizinosaur<#RN#>- Spinosaur<#RN#>- Ossidon<#RN#>- Magnapaulia<#RN#>- Deinocheirus (Wild ARK)<#RN#>- Tarchia<#RN#>- Fasolasuchus loricatus<#RN#>- Tyrannotitan<#RN#>- Deinosuchus<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>The following creatures from other mods by Shadlos are able to also challenge Smok<#RN#>- Acrocanthosaurus (Shad's Critter Reworks)<#RN#>- Gunesh Magni (AC: Mythology)<#RN#>- Mongrel Cyclops (Shad's Atlas Imports)<#RN#>- Oxalaia (IoM: Oxalaia)<#RN#>- Spearcrest (IoM: Spearcrest)<#RN#><#RN#>Good luck, Survivor.<#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在你的坐骑上使用此物，开启斗蜥龙鳄的驯服流程。<#RN#><#RN#>原版生物（或其衍生亚种）以及野性方舟模组生物，是仅有的能够挑战斗蜥龙鳄的物种：.<#RN#>- 霸王龙<#RN#>- 镰刀龙<#RN#>- 棘背龙<#RN#>- 奥西顿<#RN#>- 巨保罗龙<#RN#>- 恐手龙 <#RN#>- 多智龙<#RN#>- 法索拉鳄（AC）<#RN#>- 魁纣龙<#RN#>- 恐鳄<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>以下为该作者其它模组生物，同样可以挑战斗蜥龙鳄：<#RN#>- Acrocanthosaurus (Shad's Critter Reworks)<#RN#>- Gunesh Magni (AC: Mythology)<#RN#>- Mongrel Cyclops (Shad's Atlas Imports)<#RN#>- Oxalaia (IoM: Oxalaia)<#RN#>- Spearcrest (IoM: Spearcrest)<#RN#><#RN#>Good luck, Survivor.<#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
